			"parentId": "at://did:plc:hewhabm3uw73cbz27uwuydcg/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvnqz3cdzc2f",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3mvnrhjns4k22",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-16T18:30:02.067Z",
			"content": "<p>I’m curious what the costs are. My hunch would be that Shadow DOM has overhead costs but are those costs better than dumping everything into light dom when you hit 100 instances? 1000? I suppose i can test this myself just curious if folks have done it already</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvnrlczx3k2n",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tbroyer.ltgt.net/post/3mvnrlczx3k2n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Thomas Broyer",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tbroyer.ltgt.net",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wwv7b2hkcaghqlyy4mew2tzs/bafkreihrqndj2znuvrww4i6apcquaupotcyo74imlxzlb7kihndwf7xhsy"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-16T18:32:09.342Z",
			"content": "<p>Nolan Lawson made some measuring a few years ago about style performance:<br>\n<a href=\"https://nolanlawson.com/2021/08/15/does-shadow-dom-improve-style-performance/\">nolanlawson.com/2021/08/15/d...</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://nolanlawson.com/2023/12/30/shadow-dom-and-the-problem-of-encapsulation/\">nolanlawson.com/2023/12/30/s...</a><br>\nAnd even made a talk about it:<br>\n<a href=\"https://nolanlawson.github.io/css-talk-2022/\">nolanlawson.github.io/css-talk-2022/</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:hewhabm3uw73cbz27uwuydcg/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvns4sqtjk2w",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvnrhjns4k22",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/knowler.dev/post/3mvns4sqtjk2w",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2026-09-16T18:41:56.247Z",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:hewhabm3uw73cbz27uwuydcg/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvnsbumfmk2x",
