			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:ec64xv7n5dszeizw56yr6b5h/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvnsf4vcum2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:hewhabm3uw73cbz27uwuydcg/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvns4sqtjk2w",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/justinfagnani.com/post/3mvnsf4vcum2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Justin Fagnani",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/justinfagnani.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ec64xv7n5dszeizw56yr6b5h/bafkreif2i73jwfh77gngf3yitfvlhceke4xruijblwxcg7e2m4wxin37q4"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-16T18:46:35.315Z",
			"content": "<p>This is about right. ShadowRoots and slots are Nodes and have some unavoidable costs. But then some style calcs are cheaper, and quite often you can make simpler DOM and styles when you don't have to be defensive.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
