			"date": "2026-09-17T15:53:52.276Z",
			"content": "<p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:343p6xcgmvkpz5abgezlgyep\">@bram.us</a> added some benchmarks: <a href=\"https://chrome.dev/css-selector-benchmark/benchmarks/light-vs-shadow/mount/\">chrome.dev/css-selector...</a></p>\n<p>Seems like Light &gt; Shadow &gt; Light/Shadow 50/50 mix</p>",
