			},
			"date": "2026-09-18T04:39:48.170Z",
			"content": "<p>With the recalcs I’m also curious if css containment has any positive impact. That was a thing I wanted to see stencil have back in the day since adding the style tag would trigger expensive recalcs but using the constructae/adoptedStylesheets significantly improved recalc/restyles.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
